      "name": "arm_sorting",
      "label": "Arm sorting",
      "category": "Sorting",
      "description": "On enable, zeroes Herkulex 4 and sets the bumpers OFF. A 0.50 s confirmed inductive detection selects gate +30 degrees and holds the bumpers ON. After detection clears, the bumper stays ON for 2 seconds and the gate stays at +30 for 5 seconds before returning to -30. With no detection the bumpers pulse for one second every 20 seconds.",
